# The Sentry, Golden Guardian: "When The Sentry enters, target opponent creates The Void, a legendary 5/5 black Horror Villain creature
# token with flying, indestructible, and 'The Void attacks each combat if able.'" Bot1 casts The Sentry (5/5 flying, vigilance,
# indestructible) on turn 1; Bot2, the opponent, creates The Void under its control. It was under Bot2's control before Bot2's turn
# 2 began, so it can attack, and it must: declaring no attackers is refused (the refusal), and when it attacks Bot1 takes 5 (to 15).

[Bot1 Deck]
The Sentry, Golden Guardian
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Plains x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Island x20

